OL,3,GNEWSALando Norris-signed elephant helps
OL,4,Araise #240k for hospice
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn auction of a charity's decorated
OL,7,Felephant models from its summer art
OL,8,Ftrail has raised more than #240,000.
OL,10,FThe top price of #20,000 was paid for a
OL,11,Fcasting signed by McLaren Formula One
OL,12,Fracing driver Lando Norris, who signed
OL,13,Fthe constructor's Elenorris model.
OL,15,FArtists, including Oscar-winning author
OL,16,Fand illustrator Charlie Mackesy,
OL,17,Fcollaborated with Thames Hospice for
OL,18,Fits Trunks across the Thames project.
OL,20,FThe 30 elephants were placed at public
OL,21,Flocations in Slough and Windsor between
OL,22,FJuly and September.
